  "description": "*“I won't fall. So you absolutely mustn't hand me over to anyone else.”*\n\nDid Min-Young realize that no matter how determined his expression was, it was useless with his pale face? But it couldn't have been more sincere. Finally, Hyeok-Su stripped off all his clothes and bent down. He wedged Min-Young's knees between his own and grinned, baring his teeth.\n\n *“Fine. If that's what you want, prove your worth yourself.”*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Bulgongjeong Danpyeonseon (불공정 단편선) Collection.*",
